227 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H5
/P 54 0 R
/T (There is a Micro USB interface on the back of this product. When the product is powered off, use a USB data cable to connect it to a PC, and the PC will automatically generate a removable disk. Multiple folders can be created in the removable disk. The folder format is fixed to five digits "AW***". Each folder corresponds to an audio channel, i.e. AW001-AW255, corresponding to the 1st channel to the 255th channel respectively. Copy the prepared audio files to the corresponding folders. The audio format supports WAV and MP3 formats.)
/E (There is a Micro USB interface on the back of this product. When the product is powered off, use a USB data cable to connect it to a PC, and the PC will automatically generate a removable disk. Multiple folders can be created in the removable disk. The folder format is fixed to five digits "AW***". Each folder corresponds to an audio channel, i.e. AW001-AW255, corresponding to the 1st channel to the 255th channel respectively. Copy the prepared audio files to the corresponding folders. The audio format supports WAV and MP3 formats.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
